flowchart LR
    Start[Task] --> Branch{Simple or complex?}
    Branch -->|Simple| Small[Answer or edit]
    Branch -->|Complex| Outcome[Agree outcome + criteria]
    Outcome --> Tasks[Bounded tasks]
    Tasks --> Implement[Implement]
    Implement --> Validate{Criteria pass?}
    Validate -->|No| Fix[Focused fix]
    Fix --> Validate
    Validate -->|Yes| Close[Save useful context]
    Close --> Next[Review or next request]
